Z||000004||Derek85gT||11-28-2001||10:53 AM||||I've heard a few fiero friends tell the tale of fiero woes.  Alot of mechanics do not want to touch these cars...Im not the utmost on fieros but Ive replaced my doors(to ones with electric windows), notchback to fastback, all GT effects(bumpers, side skirts..etc), added upper and lower scoops(molded in top scoops)[3/4 window scoops], added 7 1/2 stations(molded stations to trunk and wing) Put the bottom of a wrecked GT front bumper on my replaced GT front bumper,rebuilt my motor, replaced my trans.(twice...4 speed to 5 speed(broke) then to another 5 speed) Replaced all bushings while changing my suspension to coil overs(Hal), added 10" subbox(fiberglass[sounds great]{not really hard to make}).  Next Im planning to add to the rear bumper and add 2 12" subs in custom fiberglass enclosings.||||reg||9
